unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5869689Z THREE WAYS TO RESOLVE THIS — pick one deliberately:
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5870129Z 
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5870659Z   1. AUTHOR THE CONTENT. Usually the right answer. Editing one doc in
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5871727Z      content/ is enough to turn the row green, and that one doc is proof the
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5872409Z      path works end to end.
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5872616Z 
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5873053Z   2. IT IS NEW — add it to EXEMPTIONS in this file with
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5873864Z      { status: "landing", since: "<today, ISO>", why: "…" }.
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5874766Z      That suppresses the failure for 30 days and then fails again,
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5875590Z      so the migration cannot be forgotten.
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5875895Z 
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5876590Z   3. ZERO IS CORRECT AND PERMANENT — add it to EXEMPTIONS with the status
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5877561Z      that says WHY: "default-live" (the behaviour ships from a code default
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5878691Z      and the field only overrides it), "runtime-authored" (code synthesizes
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5879858Z      the doc), "schema-impossible" (another rule forbids setting it here),
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5911477Z      "superseded" (dead field kept for compat), "legacy-parked" (the only
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5913542Z      doc that adopts it moved to content/_legacy/ — name it as `witness`),
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5914255Z      or "debt" (it IS broken,
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5915101Z      you are recording it rather than fixing it now — debts print as a loud
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5915939Z      banner on every run).
unit	Workspace tests (vitest, coverage beacons on)	2026-09-09T15:57:21.5916187Z 
